      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "test(agents): register session lock helpers in vitest workers",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe latest mainline node compact shards import `src/agents/session-write-lock.test-support.ts` from Vitest worker environments where `process.env.VITEST` is not guaranteed to be set during module evaluation. `session-write-lock.ts` then skips registering `openclaw.sessionWriteLockTestApi`, and the test-support module fails at import time with `TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'testing')`.\n\nThis blocks unrelated PRs, including #108010 and #102292, in `checks-node-compact-large-4` and `checks-node-compact-large-5`.\n\nThe fix keeps production behavior unchanged and expands the existing test-only registration guard to also recognize Vitest worker markers used by this repo: `VITEST_MODE`, `VITEST_POOL_ID`, and `VITEST_WORKER_ID`.\n\n## Evidence\n\nExact-head proof for `63c4c515cfcc60e1bd7b34e8483b6f1733592bab`:\n\n- `PATH=\"...\" ./node_modules/.bin/oxfmt --check --threads=1 src/agents/session-write-lock.ts` -> passed\n- `PATH=\"...\" ./node_modules/.bin/oxlint src/agents/session-write-lock.ts` -> passed\n- `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD` -> passed\n- `PATH=\"...\" node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/gateway/server-startup.test.ts src/gateway/server-startup-session-migration.test.ts` -> 2 files / 17 tests passed\n- `PATH=\"...\" VITEST_POOL_ID=1 node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/gateway/server-startup.test.ts src/gateway/server-startup-session-migration.test.ts` -> 2 files / 17 tests passed, covering the worker env marker used by the patch\n\nObserved CI failure this targets:\n- `checks-node-compact-large-4`: `src/agents/session-write-lock.test-support.ts:44:36 TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'testing')`\n- `checks-node-compact-large-5`: same import-time failure in auto-reply shard",
        "branch": "fix/session-write-lock-vitest-worker-api",
        "head_sha": "63c4c515cfcc60e1bd7b34e8483b6f1733592bab",
